ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp176: COMPOSITE_CURVE bottom-edge 3D curve lists its two LINE segments out of connected order: segment[0]=(5,0,0)->(10,0,0) (should be second) precedes segment[1]=(0,0,0)->(5,0,0) (should be first). Endpoints connect exactly (no gap, unlike Gp034) once reordered by connectivity -- exercises composite-curve-level FixReorder, not an EDGE_LOOP-level scramble (cf. Twi007). */
